{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chenghuang-e-o058","title":"山贼猝至宣城泰奋激卫权被十二创","accounts":[{"id":"chenghuang-a-9be90c75fad88b43ec8a","label":"正文","text":"山贼猝至宣城泰奋激卫权被十二创","evidence":["chenghuang-q-a688d3b954c339133609"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0004","role":"奋激、投身卫权胆气倍人、身被十二创良久乃苏","evidence":["chenghuang-q-a688d3b954c339133609"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"住宣城使士自卫不能千人、意尚忽略不治围落、始得上马、是日无泰几危殆","evidence":["chenghuang-q-a688d3b954c339133609"]},{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"讨六县山贼、深德之、补泰春谷长","evidence":["chenghuang-q-a688d3b954c339133609"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-a688d3b954c339133609"]},"ordering_evidence":"chenghuang-q-a688d3b954c339133609","source_order":[55,105,14],"order":9818}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0099","name":"孙策","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0004","name":"周泰","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-a688d3b954c339133609","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-36a7e8afe70fd3664a3e","layer":"original","quote":"策讨六县山贼，权住宣城，使士自卫，不能千人〖3〗。意尚忽略，不治围落〖4〗，而山贼数千人猝至。权始得上马，而贼锋刃，已交于左右，或斫中马鞍。众莫能自定，惟泰奋激〖5〗，投身卫权，胆气倍人；左右由泰，并能就战。贼既解散，身被十二创，良久乃苏。是日无泰，权几危殆；策深德之〖6〗，补春谷长","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":104,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
